LISA includes source adapted from the projects below and was checked against
the reference implementations listed at the end. This file is the single place
where external projects are named. Paths are relative to the repository root;
per-file copyright headers, adjacent licence files and provenance JSON files
(with exact source revisions and hashes) remain beside the code and are not
replaced by this summary. Model weights are never redistributed and keep their
own licences.


