Splash
------
https://github.com/incoai/splash — Apache-2.0 (revision
2afc7337aacc044722fa95e4cb3da75c281a19a8).

- The Inkling decode/verify step's kernels in
  crates/lisa-metal/src/shaders/reference/: relative attention over paged
  INT8 keys and values, short convolutions, block residual mixes, message
  gates, MoE routing, grouping, expert passes and combine, dense GGUF tiles
  (column, register, staged and prefill, fused segments, the int8 prefill
  tile), float tiles, normalization,
  row copies, embedding, logit finishing, the plane repack, RoPE tables, the
  DFlash2 draft kernels (context prefill included) and the sampling kernels (draft tree selection,
  verify-row layout, acceptance, candidate selector). Headers are inlined and
  the code is otherwise unchanged; adjacent LICENSE-APACHE-2.0, LICENSE-GGML
  for its ggml-derived tables, and provenance.json with source hashes.
- Host code following its runtime: the generic dispatch
  (crates/lisa-metal/src/kernels/ggml/reference_dispatch.rs), the plane repack
  (reference_planes.rs, after runtime/model/GgufPreparation.cpp and
  GgufImage.cpp) and the tree selection (reference_tree.rs); the step's
  schedule, state layout, tile and split selection and dispatch order in
  crates/lisa-engine/src/bindings/inkling2/step/ (runtime/model/
  Inkling2Loop*.cpp, QwenTarget.hpp's layer loop and Runtime.cpp's prefill
  chunking, runtime/ops/ host code, KernelSelection.cpp and
  KernelCalibration.hpp), including the prompt prefill and the DFlash2 draft
  step and its context prefill (DFlashDraft.cpp,
  DraftAttention.cpp, DraftSelector.cpp, RoPE.cpp); the af4g64 draft image in
  crates/lisa-engine/src/weights/inkling2/dflash.rs (DraftCheckpoint.cpp and
  the GgufPreparation.cpp quantizer); and the tree round control in
  crates/lisa-engine/src/speculation/tree.rs (lookup acceptance prior table
  and rates, acceptance-model fit, step costs and row choice, after
  VerifyBudget.cpp, LookupProposals.cpp, StepCosts.cpp and Runtime.cpp).

