2. Reference implementations
============================

Used as numerical oracles, design references or platform contracts; no source
is copied unless listed above. A reference does not imply that its arithmetic
or performance applies to LISA.

- Apple MLX: v0.32.4 and c69303b00f5f61860436e832f23fa8c34b96f93a
  (https://github.com/ml-explore/mlx).
- DS4 (https://github.com/antirez/ds4): GLM and DeepSeek execution reference
  at b3f50180ec2c7324892be1f50bc83555ccb8d5e7; legacy GLM reference at
  b4e3faf5262b21db94ec309cf321640ff1eed460.
- llama.cpp (https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp): Qwen 27B GGUF reference
  and Inkling Metal capability reference at
  29b52d398b294509746ec0a3f28948a3107c0213.
- MLX-Serve (https://github.com/ddalcu/mlx-serve): GLM vision reference
  (6c43061); MLX-Serve GGUF kernels (https://github.com/ddalcu/mlx-serve-gguf,
  c32bb7b06ec372551219604254193e18f9341bd4).
- Olala: architecture paper (https://huggingface.co/OVHaiLLM/Olala-v1.0-mini-7A1B),
  OVHai-LLM llama.cpp at 55c22dca0c987f247c21b427c3b3a09e1a28187f and mlx-engine
  at 58083ca0ac4ca0654b508f74e1bdf7b6e0e173f4 (https://github.com/OVHai-LLM).
- MTPLX v2.13.0 (https://github.com/youssofal/MTPLX, bebe21b5ba36af3688335ab66d365509fd042fad):
  Inkling round program, executor, prompt routing and quantization recipes.
- Qwen MTP: Layr Labs qwen-3.8-mtp-challenge
  (https://github.com/Layr-Labs/qwen-3.8-mtp-challenge, 0863b06ac16e26e48fc06e97444095b00feb66d4).
- Inkling serving references: TokenSpeed recipes (https://lightseek.org/tokenspeed),
  vLLM (https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm, c6b1b800ec856e2cf504a10df8f8626bb6e24152),
  SGLang (https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang, a8ac86595c72cdd2f340a986020bdad69a06b65e),
  Ollama (https://github.com/ollama/ollama, 318ee284aa3b5558de57efefff730ea33c4a9bef)
  and Strata (https://github.com/Niko1221/Strata, v0.2.19).
- FLUX checkpoints: mlx-community/flux2-klein-4b-4bit
  (860e87183ceb29e39627c0612ebd66d8ea66e68c), mlx-community/flux2-klein-9b-4bit
  (f0c62655b9da432932ba24d4bfce8a96800cf0bd), black-forest-labs/flux-3-image-klein
  (09561231f44e41381c461caf53d5452005a60ac9), prism-ml/bonsai-image-binary-4B-mlx-1bit
  (d1b3ac11a7f1ba61d84b277339daeeed4a98e0e2).
- Optimization references: Sushi (https://github.com/beamivalice/sushi) and the
  inference-optimisation skill (https://github.com/sybil-solutions/inference-optimisation-skill).
